# One line-ending rule for every platform: LF in the repository and in every
# checkout. Without it, Windows autocrlf rewrites files on checkout, and files
# that tools regenerate with LF (src/routeTree.gen.ts after `npm run dev`) show
# up as modified even though their content is unchanged.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
